<title>USA: Fibreboard Corp CFO James Donohue resigns.</title>
<headline>Fibreboard Corp CFO James Donohue resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fibreboard Corp said Thursday that James Donohue, its chief financial officer since 1991, has resigned to join Vail Resorts Inc as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Vice President and Controller Garold Swan will assume Donahue's responsibilities.  </p>
<p>A company spokesman said Fibreboard is not seeking a replacement to fill Donohue's position.</p>
</text>
